      "section": "opening",
      "slot": "opening",
      "text": "Aspose.Page FOSS for Python reads PostScript (.ps), Encapsulated PostScript (.eps), and XML Paper Specification (.xps) files, and converts them to PDF. It writes raster images in PNG (.png), JPEG (.jpeg), BMP (.bmp), and TIFF (.tiff) formats. It provides modules for working with PostScript, EPS, XPS, PDF, and image formats through the aspose.page.mcp, aspose.page.ps, aspose.page.xps, aspose.page.pdf, and aspose.page.image packages."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "format:input.eps",
        "format:input.ps",
        "public_symbol:aspose.page.pdf",
        "public_symbol:aspose.page.ps"
      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:1",
      "text": "It reads and parses .ps and .eps documents using a full PostScript interpreter and extracts DSC/EPS metadata."
    },
