      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "Aspose.Page FOSS for Python provides entry points through the aspose.page.mcp module for high-level conversions and metadata extraction, and through dedicated modules for PostScript, XPS, PDF, and image processing. The aspose.page.mcp module offers handlers that wrap lower-level APIs to convert between formats and inspect document properties."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "example:001",
        "example:004",
        "example:005",
        "identity:ecosystem",
        "identity:family",
        "identity:platform",
        "identity:product-knowledge-refresh",
        "identity:repository",
        "identity:revision",
        "package:name",
        "package:python_requires",
        "public_symbol:aspose.page.mcp"
      ],
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.page.mcp",
      "text": "The aspose.page.mcp module provides high-level handlers such as ps_to_pdf, eps_metadata, and xps_to_pdf that accept McpInput and McpOutput objects to convert PostScript, EPS, and XPS documents to PDF or image formats and extract metadata."
    },
    {
