      ],
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.page.ps",
      "text": "The aspose.page.ps module supports reading and writing PostScript and Encapsulated PostScript (.ps and .eps) files through classes like PsDocument, PsCanvas, and DscMetadata, enabling document creation, modification, and conversion to PDF or raster images."
    },
    {
